<instruction name="VCVTPH2PD">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Convert Packed FP16 Values to FP64 Values</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1045959">
   <string>This instruction converts packed FP16 values to FP64 values in the destination register. The destination elements are updated according to the writemask.</string></para>
  <para unique="1045960">
   <string>This instruction handles both normal and denormal FP16 inputs.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
